      "parent_id": "section-569b92026dfae6ff3ed0",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "K8S集群软件故障排查 / 插件维护管理 / sriov-network-operator\n        openshift.io/intelnics1: '1'\n      limits:\n        openshift.io/intelnics1: '1'\n等待pod启动，除了pod默认的网卡eth0，新增了sriov附加的vf网卡net1，该网卡名称在pod annotations.interface中定义。\n卸载sriov-network-operator网络插件\n说明：请按照以下顺序卸载sriov-network-operator插件，否则可能无法完全卸载或清理sriov-network-operator创建的相关资源。\n清理sriovnetworks自定义资源\n$ kubectl -n sriov-network-operator delete sriovnetworks --all\n清理sriovnetworknodepolicies自定义资源\n$ kubectl -n sriov-network-operator delete sriovnetworknodepolicies --all\n卸载sriov-network-operator helm chart\n$ helm -n sriov-network-operator uninstall sriov-network-operator",
