          "chunk_id": "chunk-dfb2ade10dce41a74ff195f5",
          "text": "K8S集群软件故障排查 / 插件维护管理 / sriov-network-operator\nkind: SriovNetwork\nmetadata:\n  name: sriovnetwork1\n  namespace: sriov-network-operator\nspec:\n  ipam: |\n    {\n      \"type\": \"host-local\",\n      \"subnet\": \"10.56.217.0/24\",\n      \"rangeStart\": \"10.56.217.171\",\n      \"rangeEnd\": \"10.56.217.181\",\n      \"routes\": [{\n        \"dst\": \"0.0.0.0/0\"\n      }],\n      \"gateway\": \"10.56.217.1\"\n    }\n  vlan: 0\n  resourceName: intelnics\n查看创建的sriovnetworks自定义资源\n$ kubectl -n sriov-network-operator get sriovnetworks\nNAME            AGE\nSriovNetwork1  6h28m\n创建SriovNetworkNodePolicy\n$ vim SriovNetworkNodePolicy1.yaml",
